&lt;p style="margin-left: 102px; text-align: left; text-indent: -24px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 60px; text-align: left"&gt;③　単価情報&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 84px"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 396px"&gt;
